OL,3,GNEWSAPolice name pedestrian killed in
OL,4,AWest Lothian hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian who died following a
OL,7,Fhit-and-run in West Lothian has been
OL,8,Fnamed by police.
OL,10,FRaffaele Bramante, from Linlithgow, was
OL,11,Fstruck by a grey Renault Clio on the
OL,12,Ftown's Main Street at about 00:20 on 30
OL,13,FAugust.
OL,15,FBramante, 48, was pronounced dead at
OL,16,Fthe scene.
OL,18,FA 27-year-old man has been arrested in
OL,19,Fconnection with the incident and Police
OL,20,FScotland said inquiries were ongoing to
OL,21,Festablish the full circumstances.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
